  "selection_policy": "Outcome-independent successor to terminal sota-v4: retain its seven non-Qwen identities and replace the terminal Qwen slot with Google Gemini 3.7 Flash on the public Google AI Studio route. This replacement was selected from public catalog metadata before any sota-v5 route, smoke, panel, or result evidence. No sota-v4 result is used to rank or tune the replacement. Every exact route, privacy setting, reasoning-disabled behavior, JSON behavior, and request-cap behavior requires fresh authenticated zero-completion preflight and one separately authorized strict smoke.",
